---
pagination:
  data: festivalIndex.monthPages
  size: 1
  alias: maand
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "{{ maand.url }}"
layout: layout.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Film festivals in {{ maand.name }}"
  seo_title: "Film Festivals and Markets in {{ maand.name }}: {{ maand.count }} European Events | Tubes"
  description: "The {{ maand.count }} European film festivals, markets and industry events that take place in {{ maand.name }}, with dates, industry programme and how to submit."
  excludeFromLlms: true
---
{#- Kalenderpagina. Hier is onze lijst wel het antwoord: wie wil weten wat er
    in oktober speelt, heeft een overzicht nodig en niet de site van een enkel
    festival. Een evenement dat over twee maanden loopt staat in allebei. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/film-festivals/">Film festivals and events</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ maand.name }}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="/film-festivals/">Calendar</a></p>
      <h1>Film festivals and industry events in {{ maand.name }}</h1>
      <p class="company-summary">
        {{ maand.count }} European events run in {{ maand.name }}, from festivals with an industry strand to co-production markets and trade shows. Dates move between editions, so confirm on the organiser's own site before booking travel.
      </p>
    </header>
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    {% set lijst = maand.festivals %}{% set toonType = true %}
    {% include "partials/festival-cards.njk" %}

    <h2>The months around it</h2>
    <ul class="company-chips">
      {%- for m in festivalIndex.monthPages %}
      <li><a href="{{ m.url }}">{{ m.name }} <span>{{ m.count }}</span></a></li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="{{ maand.prev.url }}">{{ maand.prev.name }}</a> &middot;
      <a href="/film-festivals/">The whole calendar</a> &middot;
      <a href="{{ maand.next.url }}">{{ maand.next.name }}</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>Budgeting a festival run?</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, so accreditation, travel and deliverables sit in the budget instead of next to it.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
